    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100893" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύνορος</span></b> , Trag. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύνουρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>marching with, conterminous</i>,
